      "body": "Fork review for velodrome-finance/indexer#910; not an upstream submission. Adds a claim-time unit-price cross-check using the voting reward pool ratio and the other trusted token price. Disagreement greater than 10x zeros both pool and user USD increments. Does not change PriceOracle or rewrite historical totals. Verification: VotingRewardSharedLogic and PriceTrust pass 71/71 tests. The new regression cases against original source fail twice, attributing USD 2,398,900 rather than zero. Full Windows suite: 1266 passed, 372 failed; observed failures include the unavailable Envio native addon (null getConfigJson). Typecheck and Linux CI are not verified; native Windows codegen fails with null runCli. Limitations: missing pool, unavailable counterparty price, or a reward token outside the pool pair leaves existing behavior unchanged. This does not establish full coverage of arbitrary bribe-token poisoning or every historical audit instance. Upstream PR creation was denied by GitHub permissions. AI-assisted contribution; no bounty or payment confirmed or claimed.",
