      "body": "### 赏金平台 / Platform\nGitHub\n\n### 原始链接 / Source URL\nhttps://github.com/Iamgoofball/-tg-station/issues/71\n\n### 漏洞描述 / Description\n[BOUNTY] [OPEN] [HIGH PRIORITY] [READY FOR AGENT] [$150 USD REWARD] Add the Ratvar Engine\n\nThe Supermatter engine is cool, but it's missing something. As such I believe that there should be the Ratvar Engine. It turns out that despite his fall, we can still make use of him.\n\nThe Ratvar engine consists in keeping the spirit of the Clockwork God Ratvar barely alive, enough to produce the power for the station.\nThe idea is to take Ratvar and make him spin extremely fast, while at the same time ensuring that he remains docile. His integrity should remain low, but not too low (or Ratvar will stop producing power), and not too high (or else he'll free himself from his chains and rampage the station!)\n\nHis integrity can be maintained by 'feeding' him bronze through a set of conveyor belts, because he's made of bronze.\nThe clockwork cult of Ratvar has an objective to free him, while the blood cult of Nar-sie (his greatest enemy) has an objective to make the engine malfunction.\n\nThe reward for this will be $150 USD. Please follow the guidelines.\n\n### 积分币奖励 / Coin Reward\n187 coins\n\n### 真实赏金（USD）/ Real Reward\n$150\n\n### 难度 / Difficulty\nMedium\n\n### 认领方式\n评论 `/claim` 锁定任务 24h\n\n### 兑换说明\n> 查看 [REWARD_POLICY.md](REWARD_POLICY.md) 了解兑换规则\n",
