      "body": "﻿## Summary\nDisplay how much XLM a student will earn on the course card and detail page. Show USD equivalent using a CoinGecko price feed.\n\n## Files to Create / Edit\n| Action | Path |\n|--------|------|\n| Create | `src/hooks/useXlmPrice.ts` |\n| Edit   | `src/components/CourseCard.tsx` |\n| Edit   | `src/pages/CourseDetail.tsx` |\n\n## Implementation Steps\n1. `src/hooks/useXlmPrice.ts`:\n```ts\nexport function useXlmPrice() {\n  const [price, setPrice] = useState<number | null>(null);\n  useEffect(() => {\n    fetch('https://api.coingecko.com/api/v3/simple/price?ids=stellar&vs_currencies=usd')\n      .then(r => r.json())\n      .then(d => setPrice(d.stellar.usd));\n  }, []);\n  return price;\n}\n```\n2. `CourseCard.tsx` â€” below the title:\n```tsx\nconst xlmPrice = useXlmPrice();\n<span>ðŸ† Earn {course.rewardXlm} XLM\n  {xlmPrice && ` (~$${(course.rewardXlm * xlmPrice).toFixed(2)})`}\n</span>\n```\n3. Use `React.memo` on `CourseCard` to avoid re-rendering all cards when price updates.\n\n## Verification Commands\n```bash\nnpm run dev\n# Visit /courses â†’ cards show 'Earn 5 XLM (~$0.55)'\n# Check Network tab: one CoinGecko request, not one per card\nnpx tsc --noEmit\nnpm run lint\n```\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] XLM reward shown on every course card\n- [ ] USD equivalent shown (blank while loading price)\n- [ ] Only one CoinGecko request regardless of card count\n- [ ] Price updates every 5 minutes",
